D\">গবেষক</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:#3D3D3D\">হলেন</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:#3D3D3D\">শিকাগোর</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:#3D3D3D\">নর্থওয়েস্টার্ন</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\">ইউনিভার্সিটি</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\">ফেইনবার্গ</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\">স্কুল</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\">অব</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Shonar Bangla&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#3D3D3D\">মেডিসিন</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;solaimanlipi&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color: