s-serif;\">এই</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">পদ্ধতি</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">একাধারে</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">বিপুল</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">সংখ্যক</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">রোগীর</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">রোগ</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">নির্ণয়ের</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">জন্য</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">উপযোগী।</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">এটি</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Vrinda, sans-serif;\">ইতোমধ্যে</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"> </span><span st